@startuml FastBite_OutboxPipeline
title FastBite — Pipeline Outbox: Service -> Cliente WebSocket

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #555
  LifeLineBorderColor #888
  ParticipantBorderColor #555
}

participant "*Service\n#[Transactional]" as Svc
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "outbox_events" as Outbox
participant "PublishOutboxEventJob\n(queue worker)" as Job
participant "DomainEventBroadcasted\n(Laravel Event)" as Event
participant "DispatchSocketMessage\n(Listener)" as Listener
participant "SocketMessageDispatcher\n+ *SocketHandler" as Dispatcher
participant "GatewayWorker\n(Workerman)" as Gateway
participant "Cliente\n(Mobile / Web)" as Client

== 1. Transacao atomica (escrita do dominio + outbox) ==

Svc -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
Svc -> DB: UPDATE estado de dominio\n(orders / payments / deliveries)
Svc -> DB: INSERT em *_events\n(audit log imutavel)
Svc -> Outbox: INSERT outbox_events\nstatus = PENDING\nnext_attempt_at = now()
Svc -> DB: COMMIT
note right of Svc #LightYellow
  Atomicidade: as 3 escritas
  ocorrem na mesma transacao
  ACID. Falha de qualquer
  uma -> rollback total.
end note

== 2. Worker consome outbox ==

loop continuamente (queue worker)
  Job -> Outbox: SELECT status=PENDING\nORDER BY next_attempt_at\nLIMIT 1
  Job -> Outbox: UPDATE status=PROCESSING\n(claim atomico)
  Job -> Event: Event::dispatch(\nDomainEventBroadcasted\n)

  alt sucesso
    Event -> Listener: subscribed (Laravel Event System)
    Listener -> Dispatcher: forward(event)
    Dispatcher -> Dispatcher: select handler\nby event_name
    Dispatcher -> Gateway: push(channels, payload)
    Gateway -> Client: mensagem JSON\n(canal subscrito)
    Job -> Outbox: UPDATE status=PUBLISHED\npublished_at = now()
  else falha (gateway down, network error, etc.)
    Job -> Outbox: UPDATE status=PENDING\nretry_count++\nnext_attempt_at += backoff\nlast_error = ...
    note right of Job #LightCyan
      Retry com backoff
      garante at-least-once
      delivery.
      Idempotencia no cliente
      via aggregate_id +
      event_name + created_at.
    end note
  end
end

== 3. Atalho direto (apenas tracking GPS) ==

note over Svc, Gateway #PaleGreen
  Para CourierPositionUpdated (alta frequencia,
  tolerante a perdas pontuais), o DeliveryService
  publica DIRETAMENTE no Pusher, sem passar
  pelo outbox. As transicoes de estado criticas
  passam sempre pelo outbox.
end note

@enduml
